{"2253200": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "The Devil's Face", "steam_appid": 2253200, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [2681160], "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gamestory</h2>Jonathan, our hero, is a second-generation Christian Orthodox immigrant. He and his brother Christian were involved in a car accident. Jonathan, the driver, was able to escape from the burning vehicle, but Christian was not so lucky. Tragically, Jonathan watched as his brother burned to death. Wracked with guilt over not being able to save his brother and haunted by strange visions, Jonathan decided to end his own life.<br><br>However, this began his journey to the afterlife, where he will be judged for his actions and forced to live eternally in the hell, he has created for himself.<br><br>The Devil's Face is based on the beliefs of an existing pagan sect and the &quot;The Book of Demons&quot; accounts of the afterlife. It is aimed at players who want to experience a horror game with a deeper meaning.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> <strong>Immersive first-person gameplay:</strong> Delve deep into a haunting world brought to life with stunning visuals and atmospheric sound design.<br></li><li> <strong>Creepy and atmospheric environment:</strong> The environment of our game is designed to be creepy and atmospheric, which creates a sense of tension and unease in the player.<br></li><li> <strong>Challenging puzzles to solve:</strong> If you enjoy challenging puzzles, The Devil's Face is the game for you.<br></li><li> <strong>Uncover the dark secrets:</strong> The Devil's face is full of hidden dark secrets. Are you ready to uncover them?<br></li><li> <strong>Experience a bone-chilling horror adventure:</strong> Get ready to face your fears and immerse yourself in a world of darkness and terror.</li></ul><br><strong>Immersive First-Person Experience</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2253200/extras/eebdf6b92c67809949b59eac61d0d335.poster.avif?t=1780433074\" width=700 height=394 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2253200/extras/eebdf6b92c67809949b59eac61d0d335.webm?t=1780433074\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2253200/extras/eebdf6b92c67809949b59eac61d0d335.mp4?t=1780433074\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Terrifying Atmosphere</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2253200/extras/581022e0106984031b12efeac54fac12.poster.avif?t=1780433074\" width=700 height=394 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2253200/extras/581022e0106984031b12efeac54fac12.webm?t=1780433074\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2253200/extras/581022e0106984031b12efeac54fac12.mp4?t=1780433074\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Intriguing Puzzles</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2253200/extras/3849f6e6a8829901fefb3565c5ce8da0.poster.avif?t=1780433074\" width=700 height=394 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2253200/extras/3849f6e6a8829901fefb3565c5ce8da0.webm?t=1780433074\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2253200/extras/3849f6e6a8829901fefb3565c5ce8da0.mp4?t=1780433074\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Dark Secrets Revealed</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" auto